        "Description": "The Mookjai Republic Newspaper has been causing multiple international disputes, and it&apos;s memebrs must be taken down at all cost. Alexander Hoffman is one of the news stations best tv anchors with his annoying voice but catchy voice rythm. Mrs. Mookjai started the paper after a fight with her 1st husband. Her focuses are on keeping it contreversal. Dexy Barat is the Head Editor for the poltics section of the newspaper which is causing the most contreversay.",
